  "note": "whisper failed: URLError: <urlopen error Tunnel connection failed: 403 Forbidden (agent proxy: no rule or network setting allows this host)>",
  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "Raat ke do baje, Arham ka phone, chupke se chamka.",
      "start": 0.09,
      "end": 2.895,
      "startFrame": 3,
      "endFrame": 87
    },
    {
      "text": "Ek ladki se chhupi baatein, ghar mein kisi ko pata nahi.",
      "start": 3.27,
      "end": 5.805,
      "startFrame": 98,
      "endFrame": 174
    },
    {
      "text": "Usne socha, bas baatein hi toh hain, isme kya gunaah?",
      "start": 5.91,
      "end": 8.655,
      "startFrame": 177,
      "endFrame": 260
    },
    {
      "text": "Par har raat dil bhaari hota gaya, namaz chhoot-ti gayi.",
      "start": 8.85,
      "end": 11.835,
      "startFrame": 266,
      "endFrame": 355
    },
    {
      "text": "Phir ek raat, usne Quran mein padha, zina ke kareeb bhi mat jao.",
      "start": 12.03,
      "end": 15.705,
      "startFrame": 361,
      "endFrame": 471
    },
    {
      "text": "Kareeb bhi nahi, kyunki yeh raasta, chhoti baaton se shuru hota hai.",
      "start": 15.81,
      "end": 19.1,
      "startFrame": 474,
      "endFrame": 573
    },
    {
      "text": "Arham ne phone rakha, wuzu kiya, aur sajde mein ro pada.",
      "start": 19.41,
      "end": 22.695,
      "startFrame": 582,
      "endFrame": 681
    },
    {
      "text": "Agle din, usne Ammi se kaha, mujhe nikah karna hai.",
      "start": 23.58,
      "end": 26.715,
      "startFrame": 707,
      "endFrame": 801
    },
    {
      "text": "Allah ke liye jo chhoda, Allah usse behtar lauta deta hai.",
      "start": 26.73,
      "end": 29.655,
      "startFrame": 802,
      "endFrame": 890
    },
    {
      "text": "Is reminder ko share karo, sadqa-e-jariya ke liye, follow karo @rehanfact.",
      "start": 29.85,
      "end": 34.245,
      "startFrame": 896,
      "endFrame": 1027
    }
  ],
